---
import FlagUA from './FlagUA.astro';
---
<section class="pt-24 sm:pt-32 lg:pt-40 pb-20 sm:pb-28">
  <h1 class="reveal reveal-1 text-5xl sm:text-6xl md:text-7xl lg:text-8xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.025em] leading-[0.98]">
    Illia Nanarov<span class="cursor-blink"></span>
  </h1>

  <div class="reveal reveal-2 mt-10 max-w-2xl space-y-5 text-lg sm:text-xl text-ink-1 leading-[1.55]">
    <p>
      <span class="text-warm font-medium">Full-stack devops engineer</span>
      based between
      <span class="marker text-ink-0">Kyiv</span> and
      <span class="marker text-ink-0">Mykolaiv</span>
      <FlagUA size="xs" class="mx-0.5 -translate-y-0.5" />.
    </p>
    <p class="text-ink-2">
      Work is below.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="reveal reveal-3 mt-10 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-8 gap-y-2 text-base">
    <a href="mailto:illiamoor.work@gmail.com" class="link-underline text-ink-0">
      illiamoor.work@gmail.com
    </a>
    <a href="https://github.com/IllyaMoore" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="link-underline text-ink-1">
      github.com/IllyaMoore
    </a>
  </div>

  <div class="reveal reveal-4 mt-16 max-w-md">
    <div class="text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-widest text-warm mb-3">Now</div>
    <ul class="now-strip space-y-1.5 text-ink-1 text-sm sm:text-base">
      <li>Bring-up on the acoustic UAV array.</li>
      <li>Kanban module + CI/CD at StoryFunnels.</li>
      <li>Multi-agent sessions in Command Center.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>
